{
  "id": "HEB.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "HEB",
  "reference": "Hebrews 13",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let love of the brethren continue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Forget not to show love unto strangers: for thereby some have entertained angels unawares. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember them that are in bonds, as bound with them; them that are ill-treated, as being yourselves also in the body. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " marriage ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had in honor among all, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the bed ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " undefiled: for fornicators and adulterers God will judge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be ye free from the love of money; content with such things as ye have: for himself hath said, I will in no wise fail thee, neither will I in any wise forsake thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So that with good courage we say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember them that had the rule over you, men that spake unto you the word of God; and considering the issue of their life, imitate their faith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus Christ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the same yesterday and to-day, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not carried away by divers and strange teachings: for it is good that the heart be established by grace; not by meats, wherein they that occupied themselves were not profited. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have an altar, whereof they have no right to eat that serve the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the bodies of those beasts whose blood is brought into the holy place by the high priest ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for sin, are burned without the camp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore Jesus also, that he might sanctify the people through his own blood, suffered without the gate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us therefore go forth unto him without the camp, bearing his reproach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we have not here an abiding city, but we seek after ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " which is to come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Through him then let us offer up a sacrifice of praise to God continually, that is, the fruit of lips which make confession to his name. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But to do good and to communicate forget not: for with such sacrifices God is well pleased. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obey them that have the rule over you, and submit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": for they watch in behalf of your souls, as they that shall give account; that they may do this with joy, and not with grief: for this ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unprofitable for you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pray for us: for we are persuaded that we have a good conscience, desiring to live honorably in all things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I exhort ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the more exceedingly to do this, that I may be restored to you the sooner.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the God of peace, who brought again from the dead the great shepherd of the sheep with the blood of an eternal covenant, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our Lord Jesus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "make you perfect in every good thing to do his will, working in us that which is well-pleasing in his sight, through Jesus Christ; to whom ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I exhort you, brethren, bear with the word of exhortation: for I have written unto you in few words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Know ye that our brother Timothy hath been set at liberty; with whom, if he come shortly, I will see you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salute all them that have the rule over you, and all the saints. They of Italy salute you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace be with you all. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
